       =20
        </P>
<P class=3D"version">                &nbsp;|&nbsp;                       =
         =20
   Version: Simply Fortran 2.24                             =
</P></HEADER>
<P class=3D"sectionHeading">Pros</P>
<P class=3D"sectionText">An excellent end-to-end solution for Fortran on =
Windows,=20
based on gfortran. The optional package manager is particularly handy, =
saving=20
the user a lot of trouble with having to build external libraries. The =
developer=20
responds quickly to suggestions on the forum. I'm very impressed.</P>
<P class=3D"sectionHeading">Cons</P>
<P class=3D"sectionText">It isn't free, which is a 'con', but it's =
inexpensive and=20
certainly adds value to the underlying free tools, so I think it's =
easily worth=20
the modest cost.</P>
